<%- include('partials/header', {
    pageTitle: 'FAQ - Eco-Adventure Wildlife Park',
    heroTitle: 'Frequently Asked Questions',
    heroSubtitle: 'Quick answers to common questions',
    heroImage: '/images/hero-faq.jpg'
}) %>

<section class="page-content">

    <p class="lead">If you cannot find your answer here, please get in touch via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

    <div class="faq-list">

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What are your opening times?</summary>
            <p>The park is open <strong>every day, 9am to 6pm</strong>. The last entry is at 5pm to give you time to look around.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Are dogs allowed?</summary>
            <p>Assistance dogs are welcome anywhere on site. Other dogs are not</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is the park accessible for wheelchairs and prams?</summary>
            <p>The main loop and most exhibits are stepfree. The Treetop Walkway has a stefree entry on the east side.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I bring my own food?</summary>
            <p>Yeahwe have several picnic spots dotted around the loop</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How long does a visit take?</summary>
            <p>Most visitors spend three to four hours on site. If you want to take your time at every exhibit and watch the keeper talks, allow most of a day.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>When are the keeper talks?</summary>
            <p>Talks run hourly between 10am and 4pm. Times are posted by the entrance each morning.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is there parking?</summary>
            <p>Yes, free parking on site with overflow fields used during busy weekends. The bus from the nearest town stops at our gates.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I touch the animals?</summary>
            <p>In a few places the Reptile Handling Session is handson. Otherwise, please look but don't touch.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do you do school trips?</summary>
            <p>Yes, we run educational visits during term time. Use the contact form to ask for our schools pack.</p>
        </details>

    </div>

</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
